flowchart LR
  C[1 Customer\nSelect file + policy\nOriginal stays with customer] --> API[2 API Gateway\nHTTPS request]
  API --> L[3 Lambda in memory\nExtract → detect → redact → validate]
  L -. Scans/images only .-> T[4 Textract OCR\nText + geometry]
  T -. Return OCR result .-> L
  L -->|Checks pass| R[6 Direct response\nProtected bytes + content-free receipt]
  R --> C
  L -->|Checks fail / unsupported| E[Stop: error, no file released]
  L -. Aggregate UTC-day quota .-> D[DynamoDB quota counter]
  L -. Operational signals .-> CW[CloudWatch logs / metrics / alarms]
  CW -. Confirmed subscription .-> SNS[SNS notification]
